{"suttaId":"thi-ap20","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[8342,8478],"vripara":"468"},"segments":{"thi-ap20:0.3":"Paṭācārātherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap20:1.1":"“Padumuttaro nāma jino, sabbadhammāna pāragū;","thi-ap20:1.3":"Ito satasahassamhi, kappe uppajji nāyako.","thi-ap20:2.1":"“Tadāhaṃ haṃsavatiyaṃ, jātā seṭṭhikule ahuṃ;","thi-ap20:2.3":"Nānāratanapajjote, mahāsukhasamappitā.","thi-ap20:3.1":"“Upetvā taṃ mahāvīraṃ, assosiṃ dhammadesanaṃ;","thi-ap20:3.3":"Tato jātapasādāhaṃ, upesiṃ saraṇaṃ jinaṃ.","thi-ap20:4.1":"“Tato vinayadhārīnaṃ, aggaṃ vaṇṇesi nāyako;","thi-ap20:4.3":"Bhikkhuniṃ lajjiniṃ tādiṃ, kappākappavisāradaṃ.","thi-ap20:5.1":"“Tadā muditacittāhaṃ, taṃ ṭhānamabhikaṅkhinī;","thi-ap20:5.3":"Nimantetvā dasabalaṃ, sasaṅghaṃ lokanāyakaṃ.","thi-ap20:6.1":"“Bhojayitvāna sattāhaṃ, daditvāva ticīvaraṃ [daditvā pattacīvaraṃ (syā.)];","thi-ap20:6.3":"Nipacca sirasā pāde, idaṃ vacanamabraviṃ.","thi-ap20:7.1":"“‘Yā tayā vaṇṇitā vīra, ito aṭṭhamake muni;","thi-ap20:7.3":"Tādisāhaṃ bhavissāmi, yadi sijjhati nāyaka’.","thi-ap20:8.1":"“Tadā avoca maṃ satthā,‘bhadde mā bhāyi assasa;","thi-ap20:8.3":"Anāgatamhi addhāne, lacchase taṃ manorathaṃ.","thi-ap20:9.1":"“‘Satasahassito kappe, okkākakulasambhavo;","thi-ap20:9.3":"Gotamo nāma gottena, satthā loke bhavissati.","thi-ap20:10.1":"“‘Tassa dhammesu dāyādā, orasā dhammanimmitā;","thi-ap20:10.3":"Paṭācārāti nāmena, hessati satthu sāvikā’.","thi-ap20:11.1":"“Tadāhaṃ muditā [pamudī (ka.)] hutvā, yāvajīvaṃ tadā jinaṃ;","thi-ap20:11.3":"Mettacittā paricariṃ, sasaṅghaṃ lokanāyakaṃ.","thi-ap20:12.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","thi-ap20:12.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","thi-ap20:13.1":"“Imamhi bhaddake kappe, brahmabandhu mahāyaso;","thi-ap20:13.3":"Kassapo nāma gottena, uppajji vadataṃ varo.","thi-ap20:14.1":"“Upaṭṭhāko mahesissa, tadā āsi narissaro;","thi-ap20:14.3":"Kāsirājā kikī nāma, bārāṇasipuruttame.","thi-ap20:15.1":"“Tassāsiṃ tatiyā dhītā, bhikkhunī iti vissutā;","thi-ap20:15.3":"Dhammaṃ sutvā jinaggassa, pabbajjaṃ samarocayiṃ.","thi-ap20:16.1":"“Anujāni na no tāto, agāreva tadā mayaṃ;","thi-ap20:16.3":"Vīsavassasahassāni, vicarimha atanditā.","thi-ap20:17.1":"“Komāribrahmacariyaṃ, rājakaññā sukhedhitā;","thi-ap20:17.3":"Buddhopaṭṭhānaniratā, muditā sattadhītaro.","thi-ap20:18.1":"“Samaṇī samaṇaguttā ca, bhikkhunī bhikkhudāyikā;","thi-ap20:18.3":"Dhammā ceva sudhammā ca, sattamī saṅghadāyikā.","thi-ap20:19.1":"“Ahaṃ uppalavaṇṇā ca, khemā bhaddā ca bhikkhunī;","thi-ap20:19.3":"Kisāgotamī dhammadinnā, visākhā hoti sattamī.","thi-ap20:20.1":"“Tehi kammehi sukatehi, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","thi-ap20:20.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","thi-ap20:21.1":"“Pacchime ca bhave dāni, jātā seṭṭhikule ahaṃ;","thi-ap20:21.3":"Sāvatthiyaṃ puravare, iddhe phīte mahaddhane.","thi-ap20:22.1":"“Yadā ca yobbanūpetā, vitakkavasagā ahaṃ;","thi-ap20:22.3":"Naraṃ jārapatiṃ disvā, tena saddhiṃ agacchahaṃ.","thi-ap20:23.1":"“Ekaputtapasūtāhaṃ, dutiyo kucchiyā mamaṃ;","thi-ap20:23.3":"Tadāhaṃ mātāpitaro, okkhāmīti [ikkhāmīti (syā.), dakkhāmīti (sī.)] sunicchitā.","thi-ap20:24.1":"“Nārocesiṃ patiṃ mayhaṃ, tadā tamhi pavāsite;","thi-ap20:24.3":"Ekikā niggatā gehā, gantuṃ sāvatthimuttamaṃ.","thi-ap20:25.1":"“Tato me sāmi āgantvā, sambhāvesi pathe mamaṃ;","thi-ap20:25.3":"Tadā me kammajā vātā, uppannā atidāruṇā.","thi-ap20:26.1":"“Uṭṭhito ca mahāmegho, pasūtisamaye mama;","thi-ap20:26.3":"Dabbatthāya tadā gantvā, sāmi sappena mārito.","thi-ap20:27.1":"“Tadā vijātadukkhena, anāthā kapaṇā ahaṃ;","thi-ap20:27.3":"Kunnadiṃ pūritaṃ disvā, gacchantī sakulālayaṃ.","thi-ap20:28.1":"“Bālaṃ ādāya atariṃ, pārakūle ca ekakaṃ;","thi-ap20:28.3":"Sāyetvā [pāyetvā (syā.), pātetvā (ka.)] bālakaṃ puttaṃ, itaraṃ taraṇāyahaṃ.","thi-ap20:29.1":"“Nivattā ukkuso hāsi, taruṇaṃ vilapantakaṃ;","thi-ap20:29.3":"Itarañca vahī soto, sāhaṃ sokasamappitā.","thi-ap20:30.1":"“Sāvatthinagaraṃ gantvā, assosiṃ sajane mate;","thi-ap20:30.3":"Tadā avocaṃ sokaṭṭā, mahāsokasamappitā.","thi-ap20:31.1":"“Ubho puttā kālaṅkatā, panthe mayhaṃ patī mato;","thi-ap20:31.3":"Mātā pitā ca bhātā ca, ekacitamhi ḍayhare.","thi-ap20:32.1":"“Tadā kisā ca paṇḍu ca, anāthā dīnamānasā;","thi-ap20:32.3":"Ito tato bhamantīhaṃ [gacchantīhaṃ (syā.), gamentīhaṃ (ka.)], addasaṃ narasārathiṃ.","thi-ap20:33.1":"“Tato avoca maṃ satthā,‘putte mā soci assasa;","thi-ap20:33.3":"Attānaṃ te gavesassu, kiṃ niratthaṃ vihaññasi.","thi-ap20:34.1":"“‘Na santi puttā tāṇāya, na ñātī napi bandhavā;","thi-ap20:34.3":"Antakenādhipannassa, natthi ñātīsu tāṇatā’.","thi-ap20:35.1":"“Taṃ sutvā munino vākyaṃ, paṭhamaṃ phalamajjhagaṃ;","thi-ap20:35.3":"Pabbajitvāna naciraṃ, arahattamapāpuṇiṃ.","thi-ap20:36.1":"“Iddhīsu ca vasī homi, dibbāya sotadhātuyā;","thi-ap20:36.3":"Paracittāni jānāmi, satthusāsanakārikā.","thi-ap20:37.1":"“Pubbenivāsaṃ jānāmi, dibbacakkhu visodhitaṃ;","thi-ap20:37.3":"Khepetvā āsave sabbe, visuddhāsiṃ sunimmalā.","thi-ap20:38.1":"“Tatohaṃ vinayaṃ sabbaṃ, santike sabbadassino;","thi-ap20:38.3":"Uggahiṃ sabbavitthāraṃ, byāhariñca yathātathaṃ.","thi-ap20:39.1":"“Jino tasmiṃ guṇe tuṭṭho, etadagge ṭhapesi maṃ;","thi-ap20:39.3":"Aggā vinayadhārīnaṃ, paṭācārāva ekikā.","thi-ap20:40.1":"“Pariciṇṇo mayā satthā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ;","thi-ap20:40.3":"Ohito garuko bhāro, bhavanetti samūhatā.","thi-ap20:41.1":"“Yassatthāya pabbajitā, agārasmānagāriyaṃ;","thi-ap20:41.3":"So me attho anuppatto, sabbasaṃyojanakkhayo.","thi-ap20:42.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavā.","thi-ap20:43.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap20:44.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap20:45.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ paṭācārā bhikkhunī imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap20:46.1":"Paṭācārātheriyāpadānaṃ dasamaṃ.","thi-ap20:47.1":"Ekūposathikavaggo dutiyo.","thi-ap20:48.1":"Tassuddānaṃ –","thi-ap20:49.1":"Ekūposathikā ceva, saḷalā cātha modakā;","thi-ap20:49.3":"Ekāsanā pañcadīpā, naḷamālī ca gotamī.","thi-ap20:50.1":"Khemā uppalavaṇṇā ca, paṭācārā ca bhikkhunī;","thi-ap20:50.3":"Gāthā satāni pañceva, nava cāpi taduttari."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
